msgstr "Nuestro complemento"

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:543
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:630
msgid ""
"cannot function properly because your WordPress Memory Limit is too low. "
"Your site will experience serious issues, even if you deactivate our plugin."
msgstr ""
"no puede funcionar correctamente porque su límite de memoria de WordPress es "
"demasiado bajo. Su sitio experimentará problemas graves, incluso si "
"desactiva nuestro complemento."

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:549
#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:570
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:636
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Aprende más"

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:561
msgid "Your site has errors."
msgstr "Su sitio tiene errores."

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:564
msgid ""
"can't function as intended. Errors, including JavaScript errors, may lead to "
"visual problems or disrupt functionality, from minor glitches to critical "
"site failures. Promptly address these issues before continuing."
msgstr ""
"no puede funcionar según lo previsto. Los errores, incluidos los errores de "
"JavaScript, pueden provocar problemas visuales o alterar la funcionalidad, "
"desde fallas menores hasta fallas críticas del sitio. Aborde estos problemas "
"de inmediato antes de continuar."

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:590
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:654
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:1459
msgid "Critical Issues"
msgstr "Cuestiones críticas"

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:632
msgid ""
"Displaying the latest recurring errors from your error log file and "
"eventually alert about low WordPress memory limit is a courtesy of plugin"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar los últimos errores recurrentes de su archivo de registro de errores "
"y, eventualmente, alertar sobre el límite bajo de memoria de WordPress es "
"cortesía del complemento"

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:634
msgid ""
"Disabling our plugin does not stop the errors from occurring; \n"
"                it simply means you will no longer be notified here that "
"they are happening, but they can still harm your site."
msgstr ""
"Deshabilitar nuestro complemento no evita que se produzcan errores;\n"
"                simplemente significa que ya no se le notificará aquí que "
"están sucediendo, pero aún pueden dañar su sitio."

