#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:773
#: includes/install-checkup/_class_bill_install.php:305
#: includes/install-checkup/class_bill_install.php:324
msgid ""
"Your WordPress Memory Limit is too low, which can lead to critical issues on "
"your site due to insufficient resources. Promptly address this issue before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Su límite de memoria de WordPress es demasiado bajo, lo que puede provocar "
"problemas críticos en su sitio debido a recursos insuficientes. Aborde este "
"problema de inmediato antes de continuar."

#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:686
#: _includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:724
#: _includes/install-checkup/class_bill_install.php:314
#: _includes/install-checkup/class_bill_install.php:383
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:777
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:1011
